    "updated_at": "2026-02-19T16:45:48Z",
    "body": "These are all cases to fix (or investigate) I believe:\n \n- link href\n  - [preload](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#preload) (doesn't check for empty string but probably should) \n  - [prefetch](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#link-type-prefetch:create-link-options-from-element:~:text=prefetch%20links%2C%20given%20a%20link%20element%20el%2C%20is%20as%20follows%3A-,If%20el%27s%20href%20attribute%27s%20value%20is%20the%20empty%20string)\n  - [preconnect](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#preconnect:~:text=an-,empty%20string)\n  - [modulepreload](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#link-type-modulepreload)\n  - [default fetch and process the linked resource](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#default-fetch-and-process-the-linked-resource) (doesn't check for empty string but probably should) \n  - [stylesheet](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#link-type-stylesheet) (need to investigate)\n  - [manifest](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#link-type-manifest) (investigate)\n  - [icon](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#rel-icon) (investigate)\n  - Also see https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12178\n- [audio/video src](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#loading-the-media-resource:attr-media-src-4)\n- [source src](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#loading-the-media-resource:attr-source-src)\n- [img src](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#update-the-image-data:~:text=not%20the-,empty%20string,-%2C%20then%20set) + [here](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#update-the-image-data:~:text=previousURL%20is%20not%20the%20empty%20string)\n- [iframe src](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#shared-attribute-processing-steps-for-iframe-and-frame-elements)\n- [embed src](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-embed-element-setup-steps) (doesn't check for empty string but probably should) \n- [object data](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-object-element:~:text=If%20the%20data%20attribute%20is%20present%20and%20its%20value%20is%20not%20the%20empty%20string)\n- [track src](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#sourcing-out-of-band-text-tracks:track-url-2:~:text=If%20URL%20is%20not%20the%20empty%20string)\n- [script src](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#prepare-the-script-element:~:text=If%20src%20is%20the%20empty%20string)\n- [input type=image src](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#image-button-state-(type=image):~:text=or%20the%20src%20attribute%27s%20value%20is%20the%20empty%20string)",
